li:JointOwnerWithSurvivorshipRights a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Joint Owner With Survivorship Rights"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A joint owner who retains rights to the policy upon the death of other joint owners. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf OWNER; cluster of 2 surface variant(…"@en,
        "Joint owners must jointly satisfy signature and assignment conditions. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows joint owners must jointly satisfy obligations like signing and assigning, which are rig…"@en,
        "Joint owners share responsibility for premium payments. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms that payment by one joint owner satisfies the obligation of both, indicating shared responsibility.…"@en ;
