    rdfs:comment "A formal submission of information for consideration of life insurance coverage. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf InsuranceContract (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 19 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3."@en,
        "An application is incorporated as a component of the insurance contract. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms that the application is part of the entire contract, indicating it has a status wi…"@en,
        "Full EOI requires medical exam completion. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence explicitly states that a full EOI includes a medical examination, directly linking the application to the medical exam re…"@en ;
