        "Guarantees a minimum interest rate regardless of market. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms a floor rate is guaranteed, and the edge topology shows GuaranteeMechanism links to InterestRate.…"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty li:FloorRateGuarantee ;
            owl:someValuesFrom li:InterestRate ],
