        "Dividends excluded from index performance and credits. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows dividends are excluded from index performance and credit calculations, establishing a clear disjoint re…"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf li:InvestmentVehicle ;
    owl:disjointWith li:Exclusion ;
