li:PolicyOwnership a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Owner Rights"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Assignment requires a written instrument. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence mandates written notice or filing for assignment. The property links ownership to a document, and 'Document' is the correc…"@en,
        "Funeral home closure affects policy assignment. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The closure of a designated funeral home voids the assignment, indicating a direct effect on the effective date of a split-dollar…"@en,
        "Policy terminates when debt exceeds limit. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; PolicyOwnership and MonetaryAmount are disjoint because policy termination due to debt is a state, not a financial amount. They share…"@en,
