    rdfs:comment "A daily charge is deducted from the policy account. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms the M&E charge is deducted daily from the policy account, establishing a direct relationship. The prope…"@en,
        "A financial metric representing the theoretical value of an account independent of withdrawals. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf CONCEPT; cluster of 2 sur…"@en,
        "A notification is triggered when the account value falls below a specified threshold. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows that when account value drops below thresholds, notifications are sent t…"@en,
        "A policy component triggers growth incentives under overfunding. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows that account value growth under Option 2 triggers increased death benefits, indicating a dire…"@en,
