        "Policy cannot be transferred after termination. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; Evidence states that transfer is only allowed upon termination with specific conditions, implying eligibility is restricted post-…"@en,
        "Policy excludes guarantee on investment performance. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The hierarchy shows LifeInsurancePolicy and Portfolio as unrelated; no shared subclasses exist. The property explicitly deni…"@en,
